# Commit policy: Conventional Commits

In this repo (**mnemospark-app**), use **Conventional Commits** for every commit.

## Format

`<type>(<scope>): <subject>`

Types: `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `refactor`, `test`, `chore`, `build`, `ci`, `perf`, `style`, `revert`

## Examples

- `feat(cloudfront): add cache-control split for html`
- `fix(deploy): recover from rollback-complete stacks`

